          integralForm: "P = IV = I^2R = \\frac{V^2}{R} \\qquad W = Pt = IVt \\quad \\text{(t সময়ে সরবরাহকৃত শক্তি)}",
          relatedEquations: ["Ohm's Law", "Work Done", "Power", "Efficiency"],
